strings.map5_s03.its_like_the_busted_vial:
It's like the busted vial
I found in the director's office
at the hospital.{end}

strings.map5_s03.anyway_better_let_him_do:
{wait1 3.9}Anyway, better let him do as he
pleases. There's more than
my life at stake.{end}

strings.map5_s03.a_fine_layer_of_dust:
A fine layer of 
dust covers everything,
as if long abandoned.{end}
